List the callback options that implement LTH behaviors: FasterAI's SparsifyCallback accepts the arguments
- lth: a boolean flag indicating whether to reinitialize weights to a saved value after each pruning round;
- rewind_epoch: an integer epoch index at which to save weights for later rewinding (default 0 for classic LTH);
- reset_end: a boolean deciding whether to reset weights to the saved values after the full multi-round training ends.
These options implement both classic LTH (rewind_epoch=0) and LTH with rewinding (rewind_epoch > 0).
